  "prefLabel": "Rev 1111.02 Form MS-22, Report of Appropriations Actually Voted",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1111.02 Form MS-22, Report of Appropriations Actually Voted.\n\n(a) School districts shall complete and file within 20 days after the annual or special meeting(s) Form MS-22, report of appropriations actually voted, with the department of revenue administration.\n\n(b) Form MS-22 shall contain dated signatures of a majority of the school board, the school district clerk, and the superintendent to certify that the information contained in the form is true, correct, and accurate to the best of their belief.\n\nSource. #5072, eff 2-21-91; rpld and moved by #6125, eff 11-23-95 (formerly Rev 1111.09); ss by #6476, eff 3-26-97; amd and moved by #6869, eff 10-20-98 (formerly Rev 1111.08); ss and moved by #8306, eff 3-22-05 (from Rev 1111.01); ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1100.html"
